Adding Columns of various types
===============================
- Column VD of type Double with role X, filled with [1.0, 2.0, 3.0]
- Column VI of type Int, filled with [5, 6, 7]
- Column VS of type String, filled with ['foo', 'bar', 'baz']
- Column VB of type Bool, filled with [True, False, True]
- Column VDS of type Double, with 5 versions and role F, filled with 3.0
- Column VIS of type Int, with 5 versions and role Z, filled with 1
